# Programs that are not services but may ask init for realtime when
# started by hand (chrt). One file per program:
#
#   Exec=/bin/myprog            the absolute path, matched exactly
#   CPUSchedulingPolicy=fifo    fifo or rr
#   CPUSchedulingPriority=10    1..99, the ceiling
#
# This file lists nothing. `doc chrt` has the rest.
